OL,3,GNEWSAHas crackdown on crime in city
OL,4,Acentre worked?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew measures introduced by police after
OL,7,Fthey vowed to crack down on anti-social
OL,8,Fbehaviour in a city centre have
OL,9,Freceived a mixed response.
OL,11,FIn August, police increased street
OL,12,Fpatrols and confiscated alcohol in
OL,13,Fcentral Gloucester following issues
OL,14,Fwith people being "drunk all day long",
OL,15,Fstreet fighting and shoplifting.
OL,17,FInsp James O'Neill said the public's
OL,18,Ffeedback had been "positive, with
OL,19,Fpeople coming up to officers and
OL,20,Ftelling them that they now feel much
OL,21,Fsafer".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
